    "body": "BASE-FIRST repair for the physical owner-PC blocker `WSL_NOT_READY` on Windows 10 build 19044.\n\nNo SHERIFF policy/schema/runtime logic changes.\n\nGoal: automatically elevate, enable official WSL + VirtualMachinePlatform prerequisites, install WSL without an unnecessary user distro, survive the required reboot via one-shot resume task, verify firmware virtualization, then continue the already-proven Podman 5.8.5 -> SHERIFF Install -> Verify path.\n\nFirst commit is intentionally RED tests only.",
